{
    "query": "What is the policy regarding taxi allowances for employees?",
    "answer": "The taxi support policy for employees is regulated as follows:\n\n*   **Form of support:** Employees are provided with a taxi card or a taxi application account (Grab) that is pre-linked to the company's payment account.\n*   **Support allowance:** Depends on the job level (for example: Level 4.2 is 4,500,000 VND/month, Level 3.3 is 3,000,000 VND/month, Level 2.3 is 1,500,000 VND/month).\n*   **Payment regulations:**\n    *   If the actual cost is lower than the allowance, the difference will not be refunded.\n    *   If the actual cost is higher than the allowance, the excess amount will be deducted from the employee's salary.\n    *   Employees can request to convert the taxi support into a cash allowance for fuel/car expenses if they use their personal car.\n*   **Effective date:**\n    *   New employees: Usage rights will be granted within 03 working days (Grab) or 10–14 days (taxi card).\n    *   Upon promotion: The allowance takes effect from the month following the promotion month.\n    *   Upon job level adjustment: If the effective date falls between the 1st and 20th of the month, the support is received starting that month; if it falls between the 21st and 31st, it is received from the following month.",
    "answer_via_tool": true,
    "knowledge_sources": [
        {
            "chunk_id": "bb84ceed5f85a880cb38cda7aed9b66e826e784b3c918dd2dd03da7c411c1560",
            "document_id": "doc_e3b3fdb1e4c09b26",
            "score": 2.151513,
            "content": "## 1.1. Objective\n\nThe taxi policy is established to:\n\n- Ensure the transportation needs of VNG employees to complete the Company's work efficiently.\n- Centralize management and ensure on-time payment to service providers."
        },
        {
            "chunk_id": "5a66ee5614d9b90e80836d831fa7fb6a9a69bdc1cf426908db46cc9643f38cf3",
            "document_id": "doc_e3b3fdb1e4c09b26",
            "score": 2.054498,
            "content": "## 2.3. Target Users and Monthly Allowances\n\nThe support allowance depends on the job level, specifically regulated as follows:\n\n| Level | Allowance (VND/month) |\n|---|---:|\n| 4.2 | 4,500,000 |\n| 4.1 |  |\n| 3.3 | 3,000,000 |\n| 3.2 |  |\n| 3.1 |  |\n| 2.3 | 1,500,000 |\n\n- For newly joined Employees, AF will grant access to the Company's Grab account and send login and usage instructions within 03 working days from the start date.\n- For traditional taxis, AF will issue a taxi card within 10–14 days from the date the Employee submits the request.\n- If the actual monthly card usage cost is lower than the entitled allowance, the difference will not be refunded. Depending on the actual monthly card usage cost, any amount exceeding the entitled allowance will be deducted from that month's salary.\n- In case of using a personal car, the Employee can request to convert the Taxi Support into a cash-only car allowance added to their monthly salary."
        },
        {
            "chunk_id": "bea5f4efa38a9c8dd3e2c02623f35fd195a993718127385172a443c22cf7c5d2",
            "document_id": "doc_cf99b3308edd1efb",
            "score": 2.152689,
            "content": "### 4.2. Taxi Allowance\n\nDepending on the level or job requirements being undertaken, the Company provides a Taxi Allowance to Employees starting from the month they join the Company. Relevant details are regulated in the Taxi Support Policy issued by the AF department.\n\nIn case an Employee is promoted, the taxi allowance will take effect from the month following the effective promotion month.\n\nEmployees are provided with a taxi card or a taxi app account pre-linked to the Company's payment account."
        },
        {
            "chunk_id": "9887bd725e7fdd57c0076d9b6e1cae0e29e7c1766f44d4cc621875c0b996abc4",
            "document_id": "doc_e3b3fdb1e4c09b26",
            "score": 2.114429,
            "content": "## 2.5. Cases of Job Level Adjustment\n\n- [Garbled text/Prefix], when a new job level is adjusted, the AF department will proceed to issue taxi cards to Employees according to the allowance regulated in section 2.3.\n- The provision of Taxi Allowance support according to the newly adjusted job level is regulated as follows:\n  - New level effective date from the 01st to the 20th of the month: receive support from the effective month.\n  - New level effective date from the 21st to the 31st of the month: receive support from the following month.\n- For cases of job level adjustment with a backdated effective date, the Taxi Allowance applied in previous months will not be recalculated."
        }
    ],
